oading": "lazy", "width": 500, "height": 375, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/SB_US_41%3B_Destination_Sign_south_of_Hernando_CR_572.jpg/1280px-SB_US_41%3B_Destination_Sign_south_of_Hernando_CR_572.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/SB_US_41%3B_Destination_Sign_south_of_Hernando_CR_572.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SB_US_41;_Destination_Sign_south_of_Hernando_CR_572.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=149178177", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2024-06-08 12:44:37", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "SB US 41; Destination Sign south of Hernando CR 572", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "CC-Zero|Distance road signs in Florida|Self-published work|White on green road signs|Views from automobiles in Hernando County, Florida|May 2024 in Florida|United States photographs taken on 2024-05-31|May 2024 in road transport in the United States|Views from U.S. Route 41 in Florida|Road signs along U.S. Route 41 in Hernando County, Florida|Road signs for Land O' Lakes, Florida|Road signs for Tampa, Florida|Green and white rectangular road signs in the United States|Road signs for Masaryktown, Florida", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Tri-level distance road sign along <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Route_41_in_Florida\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:U.S. Route 41 in Florida\">U.S. Route 41</a> south of the intersection with Powell Road (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/County_Road_572_(Hernando_County,_Florida)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:County Road 572 (Hernando County, Florida)\">Hernando County Road 572</a>) near the northern edges of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garden_Grove,_Florida\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Garden Grove, Florida\">Garden Grove, Florida</a>. According to the Florida Department of Transportation, the cities and municipalities from this point are;\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masaryktown,_Florida\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Masaryktown, Florida\">Masaryktown, Florida</a> - 4 Miles<br></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Land_O%27_Lakes,_Florida\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Land O' Lakes, Florida\">Land O' Lakes, Florida</a> - 23 Miles<br></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tampa,_Florida\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Tampa, Florida\">Tampa, Florida</a> - 40 Miles<br></li></ul>\nThis was taken on May 31, 2024. An attempt to capture this sign after capturing the northbound distance sign on the previous day failed, but I was lucky enough to capture the sign a day later. Note the fact that the third southbound lane comes to an end here. US 41 narrows down from six-lanes to four-lanes south of CR 572.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2024-05-31 15:53:49", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:DanTD\" title=\"User:DanTD\">DanTD</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Zero, Public Domain Dedication", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "false", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "image/jpeg"}]}}}}